  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/654/654-9.htm",
  "statuteText": "654:9 Forms to be Forwarded. –\n\nThe provisions of this section shall apply in all cities and in all towns. The town or city clerk shall present to the next meeting of the supervisors of the checklist the voter registration forms of all persons making application to the clerk since the previous meeting of said supervisors."
